  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Procurement of goods for implementation of the project including  teaching training equipment, IT equipment, furniture etc</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Procurement of goods for implementation of the project including  teaching training equipment, IT equipment, furniture etc is a component of  Youth Education and Skills programme for economic Growth - YES4Growth reported by FCDO with a funding type of 111 - Not for profit organisation and a budget of &#xa3;1,199,577. It works in the following sector(s): Vocational training, Advanced technical and managerial training, Primary education, Upper Secondary Education (modified and includes data from 11322), Business policy and administration.</narrative>
  </description>
